        73.38239288330078,
        527.4508666992188,
        87.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "In many high TB burden settings, sputum-smear microscopy remains the primary diagnostic tool",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.38239288330078,
        527.420166015625,
        101.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "for evaluating individuals presenting with signs and symptoms of TB. However, sputum-smear",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.38239288330078,
        527.4215698242188,
        115.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "microscopy has a low sensitivity up to approximately 50% among people living with HIV  ,  (34, 35)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.4180297851562,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "who often have difficulty in producing sputum or have paucibacillary sputum. The sensitivity will vary",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.385009765625,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "with the setting and as well as with the degree of immunosuppression of the individual. Furthermore,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        527.4158325195312,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "sputum-smear microscopy cannot distinguish drug-susceptible strains from drug-resistant strains.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3824005126953,
        527.3892822265625,
        171.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "WHO recommends that TB programmes transition to replacing microscopy as the initial diagnostic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        527.4122924804688,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "test with mWRDs that detect  complex bacteria (MTBC).  Mycobacterium tuberculosis (M. tuberculosis)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.419677734375,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "The  includes two benchmarks  WHO standard: universal access to rapid tuberculosis diagnostics",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.4520263671875,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "relating to access to mWRDs as an initial diagnostic test, including one that requires the use of",
